/span></div><h3><a href="/nba-2026-final-the-new-york-knicks-are-crowned-champions-53-years-later/">NBA 2026 Final: The New York Knicks are crowned champions 53 years later</a></h3><p>The 2026 NBA Finals crowned the New York Knicks champions 53 years after their last title, as they defeated the San Antonio Spurs 4-1 in a series defined by comebacks. Mike...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2025/06/NBA-Finals-2025-Game-4-OKC-Thunder-Pull-Off-A-Comeback-to-Take-Down-Indiana-Pacers-111-104-Tie-Series-2-2-scaled-1-1024x683-1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2025</span><span class="eyebrow">Indiana Pacers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-finals-2025-oklahoma-city-already-knows-what-its-like-to-win-a-ring/">NBA Finals 2025: Oklahoma City already knows what it&#39;s like to win a ring</a></h3><p>The NBA 2025 saw a thrilling Finals between two franchises that had never tasted ring glory: the Oklahoma City Thunder, established in the city since 2008, and the Indiana Pacers....</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2024/06/descarga.jpeg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2024</span><span class="eyebrow">Boston Celtics</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-finals-2024-boston-celtics-win-ring-sixteen-years-later/">NBA Finals 2024: Boston Celtics win ring sixteen years later</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2024, the Boston Celtics returned to taste the sweetness of victory after sixteen years of waiting. To do so, they won in the finals, clearly, the truth is that they...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2023/06/20805327-1.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2023</span><span class="eyebrow">Denver Nuggets</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-finals-2023-denver-nuggets-reach-for-glory/">NBA Finals 2023: Denver Nuggets reach for glory</a></h3><p>In the 2023 NBA, the Denver Nuggets were proclaimed champions at the first opportunity they had. To do so, they clearly beat the Miami Heat in the finals 4-1. The Florida Nuggets...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2022/06/210396-1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2022</span><span class="eyebrow">Boston Celtics</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-finals-2022-golden-state-warriors-reign-again/">NBA Finals 2022: Golden State Warriors reign again</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2022, the Golden State Warriors returned four years later to win the championship ring, beating the Boston Celtics who were playing in a final that they had not...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2021/07/d326e0bfa7734ba292869c59b8f96ce4-ktyB-U410618457815EKC-980x554@MundoDeportivo-Web.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2021</span><span class="eyebrow">Milwaukee Bucks</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-finals-2021-milwaukee-bucks-return-to-reign-50-years-later/">NBA Finals 2021: Milwaukee Bucks return to reign 50 years later</a></h3><p>In the 2021 NBA Finals, the Milwaukee Bucks ended their long ring drought by beating the Phoenix Suns 2-4, who started the playoffs with a 2-0 lead and had home-court advantage....</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2020/10/lebron-james_17gf622qf7seb16e1qh3poscwr.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2020</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-2020-final-los-angeles-lakers-champion