two league titles the state of Florida returned one more year and are now four straight to dispute the...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/07/Ray-Allen.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2013</span><span class="eyebrow">Miami Heat</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2013-third-final-and-second-title-for-the-miami-heat/">NBA Final 2013: Third final and second title for the Miami Heat</a></h3><p>In the 2.013 NBA the reign of Lebron James continued, the third final and second consecutive title of the Miami Heat. This year they didn&#39;t have it as easy as last year they had a...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/07/LeBronJamesKevinDurant2012NBAFinalsQTZaEDCQWill.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2012</span><span class="eyebrow">Miami Heat</span></div><h3><a href="/2012-nba-final-lebron-james-is-crowned-king/">2012 NBA Final: LeBron James is crowned &quot;King&quot;</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2012, it will always be remembered as the year the &quot;King&quot; was crowned. Lebron James was proclaimed champion of the NBA with his Miami Heat. Putting prize to that...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/07/311307138818.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2011</span><span class="eyebrow">Dallas Mavericks</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2011-history-is-fair-with-the-dallas-mavericks/">NBA Final 2011: History is fair with the Dallas Mavericks</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2011 ... The often unfair history owed a league to the Dallas Mavericks. They did not leave as favorites. In the East, the ambitious project of the Heat, with James,...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/2010-0610-Kobe-Bryant-Kevin-Garnett-Rajon-Rondo-oprm-32038.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2010</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2010-lakers-beat-combative-celtics-to-win-second-consecutive-ring/">NBA Final 2010: Lakers beat combative Celtics to win second consecutive ring</a></h3><p>In the 2010 NBA, the Angeles Lakers are proclaimed champions for the second consecutive time, this time winning the most classic final of the NBA, beating the Boston Celtics in an...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/lakers600.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2009</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/2009-nba-final-los-angeles-lakers-proclaimed-nba-champions-seven-years-later/">2009 NBA Final: Los Angeles Lakers proclaimed NBA champions seven years later</a></h3><p>In the 2.009 NBA, the Angeles Lakers proclaimed themselves NBA champions by defeating the Orlando Magic 4-1 with some ease. Some Magic that came from defeating the favorite...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/0cb57261f5dfa45612e4e4f19375310f.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2008</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2008-22-years-later-the-celtics-return-to-the-top/">NBA Final 2008: 22 years later the Celtics return to the top</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2.008, the nostalgics were in luck, 21 years later the Boston Celtics and the Angeles Lakers faced each other in a final of the NBA. The Boston&#39;s with Garnett and...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/spurs-smother-lebron.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2007</span><span class="eyebrow">Cleveland Cavaliers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2007-the-cavaliers-pay-the-hazing-to-the-spurs/">NBA Final 2007: The Cavaliers pay the hazing to the Spurs</a></h3><p>In the 2.007 NBA, the San Antonio Spurs, surely the best team of the last years NBA, wins its fourth ring in 8 seasons against the Cleveland Cavaliers. Lebron&#39;s team suffered...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/cropped_GettyImages-114970837.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2006</span><span class="eyebrow">Dallas Mavericks</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2006-nba-mavericks-cant-handle-wades-inspiration/">NBA Final 2006 NBA: Mavericks can&#39;t handle Wade&#39;s inspiration</a></h3><p>In the 2.006 NBA, the grand final is contested by the favorite Dallas Mavericks, the dominant regular team, against the Miami Heat of Wade, O&#39;Neal and company. Victory went to the...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/160530161242-robert-horry-2005-finals.1280x720.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2005</span><span class="eyebrow">Detroit Pistons</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2005-spurs-beat-tough-pistons/">NBA Final 2005: Spurs beat tough Pistons</a></h3><p>In the 2005 NBA, an exciting final was played between two great teams, the San Antonio Spurs against the Detroit Pistons. It was a power to power final, match after match, only...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/gettyimages-81441653-2048x2048.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2004</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2004-pistons-win-ring-again-14-years-later/">NBA Final 2004: Pistons win ring again 14 years later</a></h3><p>In the NBA of 2004, all the glamour and the spotlights were taken by the Angeles Lakers when they signed two veteran all-star players, Karl Malone and Payton, who along with...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/bdc707a7074894b0edaf1bda2c329b74.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2003</span><span class="eyebrow">NBA</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2003-duncans-spurs-subdue-the-nets/">NBA Final 2003: Duncan&#39;s Spurs subdue the Nets</a></h3><p>In the NBA 2.003, the final of the NBA was disputed by the San Antonio Spurs against the New Jersey Nets, which repeated final. The final was won by the Spurs by a solvent 4-2 led...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/2002-1995-shaquille-o-neal-001254737mFinal.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2002</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2002-lakers-win-third-consecutive-ring-with-ease/">NBA Final 2002: Lakers win third consecutive ring with ease</a></h3><p>In the 2.002 NBA, the Angeles Lakers win their third consecutive ring, this time defeating a New Jersey Nets who missed the big final. The Lakers, led by the powerful couple...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/gettyimages.71053235.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2001</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2001-the-lakers-won-their-second-consecutive-ring-overwhelmingly/">NBA Final 2001: The Lakers won their second consecutive ring overwhelmingly</a></h3><p>In the 2.001 NBA, O´Neal and their Lakers continue with their tyranny, winning their second consecutive league, this time beating Iverson&#39;s Philadelphia Sixers 4-1. That lost game...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/2000finalsg1_4-1.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">2000</span><span class="eyebrow">Angeles Lakers</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-2000-lakers-begin-nba-dominance/">NBA Final 2000: Lakers begin NBA dominance</a></h3><p>In the NBA of the year 2000, the Angeles Lakers would begin their hegemony of the beginning of the decade, thanks to article 33, Shaquille O&#39;Neal, excellently seconded by Bryant....</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/da6b3fdfd739ff9a6b4fdb09b74e30ed.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">1999</span><span class="eyebrow">NBA</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-1999-spurs-twin-towers-take-advantage-of-ewings-downfall/">NBA Final 1999: Spurs twin towers take advantage of Ewing&#39;s downfall</a></h3><p>The NBA of 99 began very convulsed by the strike of players, which kept the league a few months blocked. When the differences were settled began a regular phase with fewer games,...</p></div></article><article class="card"><div class="card__media"><img src="/images/bf/2019/08/maxresdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="320" height="240"></div><div><div class="card__meta"><span class="year">1998</span><span class="eyebrow">Chicago Bulls</span></div><h3><a href="/nba-final-1998-michael-jordan-leaves-with-a-mov